              "message": "This voucher (Expense Id {form.expense_id}) is already pending or approved and cannot be resubmitted again.",
              "business_logic": {
                "method": "block_duplicate_resubmission",
                "description": "Refuse resubmission if the same EXPENSE_ID already has a pending or approved approval record",
                "spec": "On save (edit) of an EXPTRACK_EXPENSE_REPORT_NEW record, check EXPTRACK_EXPENSE.APPROVAL_STATUS for the row whose EXPENSE_ID equals the form's expense_id. If that expense's APPROVAL_STATUS is 'Pending' or its STATUS/APPROVAL_STATUS reflects an already-approved outcome, AND the current EXPTRACK_EXPENSE.STATUS is not 'Reject' (i.e. the voucher is not currently awaiting correction), return an error blocking the save. Only a voucher whose linked EXPTRACK_EXPENSE.STATUS is 'Reject' may be resubmitted. Skip the check when _action is 'add' (this form never adds records)."
              }
            }
