          "method": "resubmit_expense_voucher",
          "description": "Push the corrected voucher back to Management Approval under the same EXPENSE_ID",
          "spec": "After an edit save on EXPTRACK_EXPENSE_REPORT_NEW is staged, using the header's expense_id: (1) UPDATE EXPTRACK_EXPENSE SET CATEGORY=header.category, EXPENSE_DATE=header.expense_date, PAYMENT_METHOD=header.payment_method, RECEIPT_ATTACHMENT=header.receipt_attachment, STATUS='Submitted', APPROVAL_STATUS='Pending', CHG_DATE=now() WHERE EXPENSE_ID=header.expense_id. (2) UPDATE the corresponding EXPTRACK_MANAGE_APPROVAL_NEW_TXN record(s) (matched on EXPENSE_ID) SET STATUS='Pending', TRIP=header.trip, CATEGORY=header.category, EXPENSE_DATE=header.expense_date, PAYMENT_METHOD=header.payment_method, CHG_DATE=now() so the corrected voucher reappears for the approver. If no EXPTRACK_EXPENSE row exists for expense_id, or its current STATUS is not 'Reject', return {\"error\": \"...\"} to abort the whole save (defense in depth alongside the form-level duplicate-resubmission validation).",
          "language": "python"
        }
